  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "summary": "Surface unclassified startup failures with a typed error.code and bounded optional startup_stage (snapshot_recovery, catalog_loop_start, catalog_loop_drain, listener_serve) emitted as exactly one startup_failed line per failing exit and none on graceful shutdown (nil-preserving wrap); two documented operator-visible compatibility changes: quarantined-unrecoverable snapshot-recovery exits reclassify state_directory→snapshot_recovery (state_directory keeps its meaning for storage.Open failures) and disabled-quarantine loop.Start admission/persist-refusal exits reclassify internal_error→catalog_loop_start (internal_error stays the code for every genuinely unknown startup error); additive one-field envelope with schema_version 1 preserved and the field union 130→131 in lockstep across envelopeFieldNames, docs/logging-contract.md, internal/observe/log_test.go and the config_envelope_test.go count pin; full-path runContext tests prove one line + code + stage for catalog_loop_start, snapshot_recovery and listener_serve (listener via a release-gated serveListenerFn seam: only the named listener fails, gated until after waitFor readiness); genuine unknown stays internal_error; the ticket item 1 sanitized cause summary is the class-level static error.remediation field; no secrets or raw error text."
    }
  ],
